node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
# Generated simulation output. Only the reports that are current evidence for
# the working balance are tracked; every other run — including regenerated
# copies of retired milestone reports — is ad-hoc and stays out of git.
# See reports/REPORT_INDEX.md for what each retired report was and how to
# regenerate it. This ignores generated output only: canonical content lives in
# content/ and human-authored findings live in docs/, neither of which is
# ignored anywhere in this file.
reports/*
!reports/.gitkeep
!reports/REPORT_INDEX.md
!reports/h2b-batch008-diagnostic.md
!reports/h2b-content-lint.md
!reports/h2b1a-regression.json
!reports/h2b1a-regression.md
scratch/
dist/
